    {
      "id": "claim_6233b1d4760b4b429910b5eaf302fd85",
      "statement": "The Linux packaging is a systemd unit (onesm.service, copy at onesm-server.service) launched with G1GC, -Xms20M -Xmx100M, -Dapp.log=/var/log/onesm/onesm.log, app.port 8880, app.master_key, classpath /opt/onesm/classes:/opt/onesm/lib/*, running as user/group onesm with LimitNOFILE=20000; onesm-server-install.sh copies the unit into /etc/systemd/system and runs systemctl enable onesm.",
      "evidence": [
