      "id": "claim_a791af0d63f941458fe181bd81f6176e",
      "statement": "The macOS packaging is a /etc/init.d-style jsvc shell service (onesm-server.jsvc) that execs jsvc with -home, the JUL Log4j2 manager, -Dlog, -Dapp.port, -Dapp.master_key, classpath, run user, outfile/errfile/pidfile, and start|stop|restart actions; a simpler onesm-server.osx variant runs java directly. The jsvc script's CLASS constant com.onepay.onesm.OneSMMainLinux does not exist in the current source tree.",
