      "id": "claim_02364a6bca604557974fa2bd4f08a863",
      "statement": "The Windows packaging installs a prunsrv service (onesm-server-install.bat) with prunsrv.exe //IS//onesm, StartClass com.onepay.onesm.Main, StartMethod main, JVM mode, JVM options carrying app.port, app.master_key, locale, JUL manager, and -Dlog, classpath ../classes;../lib/*;prunsrv.jar, and StopClass Stop; onesm-server-uninstall.bat removes it with prunsrv.exe //DS//ONESMServer. The referenced Stop class is absent from the current tree.",
