      "statement": "sync_prod performs env JAVA_HOME=/usr/java/jdk-11 mvn clean then mvn -U package, rsyncs only target/classes and target/lib (with --delete, ssh port 15440) to root@dc:/root/tmp_deploy/onesm/, then sshs into the host to run meld comparing the staged tree against /opt/onesm and /opt/onesm/setown to fix ownership; tests are skipped in the build.",
